meSpaceSemanticTokensProvider for spaces","    \/\/ - OrangeThemeSizeSemanticTokensProvider for sizes","    let textAreaComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider()","","    \/\/ Or use your own size and space semantic tokens providers (or only some)","    let textAreaComponentTokensProvider = OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider(","                                            sizes: CustomSizeSemanticTokensProvider(),","                                            spaces: CustomSpaceSemanticTokensProvider())"]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.17.0","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllTextAreaComponentTokensProvider","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/19OUDSTokensComponent08TextAreaB6TokensP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/TokensProvider"],"kind":"relationships"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider/spaces":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetextareacomponenttokensprovider\/spaces","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spaces"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllSpaceSemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTextAreaComponentTokensProvider\/spaces","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of spaces semantic tokens to use for text area spaces"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"spaces","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OU